INT. FLAT 1408 - NIGHT

NADIA stands in a room whose dimensions do not fit the building outside. MR VALE sets a yellow tenancy file on the table.

NADIA
I only need to establish who is legally occupying the property.

VALE
You did that already.

He opens the file.

A signature. Nadia's name. Her handwriting.

NADIA
Where did you get this?

VALE
You brought it.
